{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Raw Base"}], "prev": {"link": "../encrypted-message/", "title": "EncryptedMessage"}, "next": {"link": "../exported-chatlist-invite/", "title": "ExportedChatlistInvite"}, "title": "ExportedChatInvite", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"exportedchatinvite\">\n<h1>ExportedChatInvite<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#exportedchatinvite\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.raw.base.ExportedChatInvite\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.raw.base.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ExportedChatInvite</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.base.ExportedChatInvite\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Telegram API base type.</p>\n<dl>\n<dt>Constructors:</dt><dd><p>This base type has 2 constructors available.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/chat-invite-exported/#pyrogram.raw.types.ChatInviteExported\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.types.ChatInviteExported\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatInviteExported</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Telegram API type.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/chat-invite-public-join-requests/#pyrogram.raw.types.ChatInvitePublicJoinRequests\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.types.ChatInvitePublicJoinRequests\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatInvitePublicJoinRequests</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Telegram API type.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</dd>\n<dt>Functions:</dt><dd